:R-HSA-1855170  a           owl:NamedIndividual , obo:GO_0033271 ;
        rdfs:comment        "Inositol phosphates (IPs) synthesised in the nucleus are imported into the cytosol from the nucleus. The molecular details of these transport processes remain uncertain (Nalaskowski et al. 2002; Ho et al. 2002, Brehm et al. 2007, Saiardi et al. 2001, Saiardi et al. 2000, Fridy et al. 2007, Leslie et al. 2002)." ;
        rdfs:label          "IPs transport between nucleus and cytosol" ;
